  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The avatars that you are more than likely to always use and do not need to redownload all the time are you own or the avatars that you favourite.\nThe same for our own worlds and the worlds you favourite.  These are the ones you are more than likely going to visit time and time again so downloading them over and over again is a waste of bandwidth both for vrchats servers and your own connection.\nWhen you clear your cashe using the in game options you then have to redownload all avatars including your own and favourites then redownload all worlds you visit.\nFor people who clear there cashe regularly this adds a big download amount to there connection and also for vrchats servers.\nIf there was a tickable option in the clear cashe menu to save own avatars/worlds and favourite avatars/worlds it could save a lot of data to be downloaded.\nIf people want to fully clear there cashe then they just need to untick the boxes. \nAvatar and world updates of course replace there saved avatars/worlds.",
